    "unit_id": "t0033.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 4951,
    "char_start": 4924,
    "end": 309.119,
    "sent_id": "t0034.s01",
    "start": 307.258,
    "text": "Where does it stop working?",
    "unit_id": "t0034.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5049,
    "char_start": 4952,
    "end": 315.583,
    "sent_id": "t0035.s01",
    "start": 309.119,
    "text": "Outside of issues related to RockShox components, the failure mode is more difficult to identify.",
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5116,
    "char_start": 5050,
    "end": 319.981,
    "sent_id": "t0035.s02",
    "start": 315.583,
    "text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5216,
    "char_start": 5117,
    "end": 325.257,
    "sent_id": "t0036.s01",
    "start": 319.981,
    "text": "Let's change the subject – I want to dedicate the final section to the management of the territory.",
    "unit_id": "t0036.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5358,
    "char_start": 5217,
    "end": 334.006,
    "sent_id": "t0037.s01",
    "start": 325.257,
    "text": "That's where the conversation becomes interesting, because the compromises surrounding land management touch upon everything we've discussed.",
    "unit_id": "t0037.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5382,
    "char_start": 5359,
    "end": 335.285,
    "sent_id": "t0038.s01",
    "start": 334.006,
    "text": "I want to delve deeper.",
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5457,
    "char_start": 5383,
    "end": 339.4,
    "sent_id": "t0038.s02",
    "start": 335.285,
    "text": "What is the opposing perspective that most listeners don't have access to?",
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5544,
    "char_start": 5458,
    "end": 345.163,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s01",
    "start": 339.4,
    "text": "It all boils down to this: drainage is the most crucial design decision for any trail.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5601,
    "char_start": 5545,
    "end": 348.916,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s02",
    "start": 345.163,
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that use RockShox components.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5691,
    "char_start": 5602,
    "end": 354.881,
    "sent_id": "t0039.s03",
    "start": 348.916,
    "text": "If you ignore this, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5729,
    "char_start": 5692,
    "end": 357.211,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s01",
    "start": 354.881,
    "text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5791,
    "char_start": 5730,
    "end": 361.052,
    "sent_id": "t0040.s02",
    "start": 357.211,
    "text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of trail construction?",
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5888,
    "char_start": 5792,
    "end": 366.319,
    "sent_id": "t0041.s01",
    "start": 361.052,
    "text": "Honestly, the most common mistake that beginner builders make is digging with too steep a slope.",
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 5969,
    "char_start": 5889,
    "end": 370.708,
    "sent_id": "t0041.s02",
    "start": 366.319,
    "text": "The framework is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6041,
    "char_start": 5970,
    "end": 375.439,
    "sent_id": "t0042.s01",
    "start": 370.708,
    "text": "Before we conclude, what is one thing that listeners can try this week?",
    "unit_id": "t0042.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6110,
    "char_start": 6042,
    "end": 379.553,
    "sent_id": "t0043.s01",
    "start": 375.439,
    "text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6140,
    "char_start": 6111,
    "end": 381.307,
    "sent_id": "t0043.s02",
    "start": 379.553,
    "text": "Everything else is iteration.",
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6196,
    "char_start": 6141,
    "end": 385.115,
    "sent_id": "t0044.s01",
    "start": 381.307,
    "text": "And finally, a big thank you to our partners at Linear.",
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6272,
    "char_start": 6197,
    "end": 390.307,
    "sent_id": "t0044.s02",
    "start": 385.115,
    "text": "Linear is the ticketing system designed for speed – built for the keyboard.",
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6302,
    "char_start": 6273,
    "end": 392.315,
    "sent_id": "t0044.s03",
    "start": 390.307,
    "text": "Check them out at linear.com.",
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01"
  },
  {
    "char_end": 6351,
    "char_start": 6303,
    "end": 395.293,
    "sent_id": "t0044.s04",
    "start": 392.315,
    "text": "Julien Mercier, thank you for this conversation.",
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01"
  },
  {
